,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"当然可以，不想说的地方你随时可以停下，不用勉强。至于我的私人情况，我可能会保留一些，不是拒你，而是想把空间留给你。你担心问多了会让我不舒服，这种怕添麻烦的感觉，是不是也常出现在你和别人相处时？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"当然可以，不想说的地方你随时可以停下，不用勉强。至于我的私人情况，我可能会保留一些，不是拒你，而是想把空间留给你。你担心问多了会让我不舒服，这种怕添麻烦的感觉，是不是也常出现在你和别人相处时？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2333,"promptTokens":924,"completionTokens":222,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 16:08:49"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":15,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007575479497375511,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6c591f4429d1fd72fbc73","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794557329596,"createTime":"2026-11-13 16:08:49","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6c591f4429d1fd72fbc73","chatId":"a1b438412c9e4ce3ac3fb4eb357c77a8","sessionId":null,"userId":100173,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"嗯……可能是吧。我总怕给人添麻烦。那个，如果以后我有些话不想说，或者……我能不能偶尔多问您一些私人的事？我不是别的意思，就是想知道您会不会介意。<第7轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":14,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007575479497375511,"emotions":[{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":5,"sort":6},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":4,"sort":2},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":3,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":2,"sort":4},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":2,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":2,"sort":9},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6af6c591f4429d1fd72fbc74","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794557329593,"createTime":"2026-11-13 16:08:49","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6c58cf4429d1fd72fbc6f","chatId":"a1b438412c9e4ce3ac3fb4eb357c77a8","sessionId":null,"userId":100173,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"不会，你问这些我很欢迎，咨询里本来就该有你的疑问。倒是你刚说“会不会觉得烦”，好像很在意别人会不会嫌你麻烦。这种担心，在生活里也常出现吗？","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"不会，你问这些我很欢迎，咨询里本来就该有你的疑问。倒是你刚说“会不会觉得烦”，好像很在意别人会不会嫌你麻烦。这种担心，在生活里也常出现吗？","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1127,"promptTokens":797,"completionTokens":82,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-13 16:08:44"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":13,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0066910691356420705,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af6c58cf4429d1fd72fbc6e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794557324982,"createTime":"2026-11-13 16:08:44","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af6c58cf4429d1fd72fbc6e","chatId":"a1b438412c9e4ce3ac3fb4eb357c77a8","sessionId":null,"userId":100173,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"就……有点堵得慌吧。回头想想又觉得自己挺没用的，连这点事都处理不好。诶，我这样问会不会太多了，您会不会觉得烦？<第6轮:让你的回答保持简短，限制每次回复中的信息量，字数限制在100字左右。一次提出一个问题，不要分点描述。>","options":null,"imageConten